<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Griffin names Sunley new managing director.</title>
<headline>Griffin names Sunley new managing director.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Griffin Shipping Holdings Ltd said on Monday that John Sunley, Hong Kong-based chief executive of Griffin Shipping (Asia), had been appointed as its new managing director from July 1.</p>
<p>The news follows the announcement two weeks ago of the resignation of Mike Meehan from July 31, 1997 to pursue his own interests.</p>
<p>Sunley joined the group in 1980 and prior to moving to Hong Kong held the post of finance director at parent company Grindrod Unicorn Group Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
